WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Two letters appear in a fast stream. You spot the first. You might miss the second.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Researchers call it the attentional blink. Your eyes can remain open the whole time.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
In one study, intensive meditation training changed performance on this particular task.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
But the training lasted months. It was not a twelve-minute commercial recording.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Before buying an audio program, separate its package features from demonstrated outcomes.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Try the free Focus Fieldbook first. Read the evidence. Decide for yourself.
